    "title": "Hoover Dam to remain closed Thursday; no reopening date announced",
    "text": "Hoover Dam remained closed to visitors Wednesday after federal officials first confirmed the closure Mondayevening.\nFederal officials have not announced a reopening date for the popular tourist site, and a spokesperson for the U.S. Bureau of Reclamation declined to say when the dam may reopen. A post on the Hoover Dam Facebook page said the dam will remain closed to visitors Thursday.",
